held-panel = Held item · local only
held-empty = No saved item · nothing included
held-saved = Saved preference · not included
held-proposed = Proposed · not included
held-included = Explicitly included as ordinary context
held-unavailable = Unavailable · no automatic inclusion
held-dismissed = Dismissed this visit · saved slot retained
held-saving = Pending save · not yet committed
held-failed = Save failed · /records-retry
held-policy = A saved preference is not permission. Accept explicitly; ordinary context selection stays independent.
held-scope = Task { $task } · { $owner } · { $form }
held-target = Item: { $target }
held-project = Project: { $project }
held-strip = Held: { $status } · { $target }
held-chip-empty = None
held-chip-saved = Saved/not included
held-chip-proposed = Proposed/not included
held-chip-included = Included (explicit)
held-chip-unavailable = Unavailable
held-chip-dismissed = Dismissed/not included
held-chip-saving = Saving/not included
held-chip-failed = Save failed
held-actions-file = /held-file choose · /held-set-file save/review renewal
held-actions-memory = /held-memory choose · /held-set-memory save/review
held-actions-accept = /held-accept review/select · /held-dismiss hide visit
held-actions-clear = /held-renew replace · /held-clear clear slot · Esc close
held-actions-ordinary = /unpin · /select-memory: ordinary context is separate
held-receipt = Frozen local request receipt
held-no-receipt = No frozen request receipt yet
held-receipt-included = Explicit ordinary contribution: included
held-receipt-excluded = Held item not included in this request
held-no-target = None
held-choose-file = Choose and inspect a file, then /held-set-file.
held-choose-memory = Highlight an approved visible revision, then /held-set-memory.
held-notice-saved = Saved locally; no automatic context selection.
held-waiting = Waiting for local persistence acknowledgment.
held-busy = Owner or persistence busy; held action refused.
held-notice-unavailable = Item unavailable; inspect the original source or exact memory revision.
held-review-file = Review the file, then use ordinary Pin to include it.
held-accepted = Explicit ordinary selection applied; send admission still applies.
held-notice-dismissed = Proposal dismissed for this visit; saved slot unchanged.
held-no-proposal = No applicable held proposal.
held-queue-full = Local queue full; preference unchanged. Retry the action.
held-too-small = Held review needs at least 60 columns and 18 rows.
held-source-hint = /held-set-file save reviewed file as held preference (not Pin)
held-memory-hint = /held-set-memory save highlighted approved revision (not select)
cmd-held = Inspect the local held preference and frozen receipt
cmd-held-file = Choose a file for the held preference
cmd-held-set-file = Save the fully reviewed file as a preference, without pinning
cmd-held-memory = Choose an approved memory for the held preference
cmd-held-set-memory = Save the highlighted exact approved revision, without selecting
cmd-held-accept = Explicitly review/pin the held file or select its approved memory
cmd-held-dismiss = Dismiss the proposal for this visit without clearing its saved slot
cmd-held-clear = Clear the saved held preference without changing ordinary context
cmd-held-renew = Choose a replacement held reference and review exact old/new identities
held-renewal-panel = Held reference · deliberate renewal / read-only inspection
held-renewal-old = OLD exact reference (retained content below if available):
held-renewal-new = NEW proposed exact reference and reviewed content:
held-renewal-old-unavailable = Exact old-reference content is unavailable; no historical memory body or saved file body/digest is invented.
held-renewal-policy = Configuration only: one reference is replaced. No pin, selection, permission or dispatch.
held-renewal-frozen = Frozen requests, current basket and literal drafts/carets stay unchanged. File retained captures are not proof of the saved file's old bytes.
held-renewal-confirm = [Keep old] Enter/n/Esc cancel · y renew exactly · Up/Down scroll
held-renewal-scroll = Read the complete scope with Down/PgDn; Enter/n/Esc keeps old.
held-inspection-policy = Read-only mapped owner/reference inspection. No lead, configuration or selection change.
held-inspection-return = Up/Down/PgUp/PgDn scroll · Esc return to invoking review
held-renewal-file-identity = Source root { $root } · lines { $start }–{ $end } · full SHA256 bytes { $digest }
held-inspection-not-configured = No reference configured
held-inspection-available = Available in cached local observations; not dispatch authority
held-inspection-unavailable = Unavailable in cached local observations
held-inspection-unknown = Availability unknown; no current successful local observation
held-renewal-file-disclosure = Path-only old reference: saved-file body/digest unavailable. Any text below is an independent retained capture, not an old-file diff.
held-renewal-content-escaped = Exact retained/proposed content uses escaped display; bytes and digest are unchanged.
held-renewal-waiting = Waiting for current local save/ownership settlement; no renewal is queued.
